{"step_index":253,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-06T13:31:53Z","thinking":"**Updating Role-Based Access**\n\nDetermining the user's role is essential for adjusting permissions. The code retrieves the user's role or defaults to a verifier role if the user isn't logged in. Next, it identifies elements related to the role scope, which likely controls icon, title, and description display. This suggests the intention is to dynamically present role-specific information within the dashboard.\n\n\n**Implementing Role-Based UI Restrictions**\n\nThe code now proceeds to selectively hide UI elements based on the determined role, specifically targeting elements that relate to qualification issuance, student browsing, and telemetry viewing. The verifier role triggers the hiding of these restricted sections. The dashboard header and role-specific display are updated to reflect the verifier's focused scope, and the role's capabilities are clearly outlined within the UI.\n\n\n**Adjusting UI Based on Role**\n\nThe code block now addresses the Institutional and Admin roles, mirroring the prior Verifier role logic to dynamically update the user interface. It focuses on revealing or hiding UI elements that correspond to each role's allowed actions, ensuring only the applicable features are accessible. Specifically, elements tied to issuing qualifications, managing the registry, and accessing telemetry are now controlled.\n\nThe Institutional role will enable issuance & registry management features, while the Admin role will grant full access. The UI is then updated with role-specific titles, descriptions, icons, and capability indicators.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Enforce role permissions, banner, and tab access in dashboard.html","EndLine":488,"Instruction":"Update role-based behavior in dashboard.html script","ReplacementContent":"            // 2. Role-based adjustments and Permission Scopes\n            const role = user ? user.role : 'ROLE_VERIFIER';\n            const roleIcon = document.getElementById('roleScopeIcon');\n            const roleTitle = document.getElementById('roleScopeTitle');\n            const roleDesc = document.getElementById('roleScopeDesc');\n            const roleBadges = document.getElementById('roleScopeBadges');\n            const btnIssue = document.getElementById('btnIssueQual');\n            const tabQuals = document.getElementById('tabBtnQuals');\n            const tabTelemetry = document.getElementById('tabBtnTelemetry');\n\n            if (role === 'ROLE_VERIFIER') {\n                if (btnIssue) btnIssue.style.display = 'none';\n                if (tabQuals) tabQuals.style.display = 'none'; // Verifiers cannot browse all registered students\n                if (tabTelemetry) tabTelemetry.style.display = 'none'; // Verifiers cannot view server JVM/telemetry\n                const regSection = document.getElementById('registerSection');\n                if (regSection) regSection.style.display = 'none';\n\n                document.getElementById('dashHeaderTitle').innerText = 'Accredited Credential Verification Portal';\n                document.getElementById('dashHeaderSubtitle').innerText = 'Verify academic credentials, inspect blockchain blocks, and evaluate AI fraud heuristics.';\n\n                if (roleIcon) roleIcon.innerText = '🔍';\n                if (roleTitle) roleTitle.innerText = `Accredited Verifier Session (${user.username})`;\n                if (roleDesc) roleDesc.innerText = 'Scope: Credential verification, blockchain validation & AI anomaly scoring. Student registry and server metrics are restricted.';\n                if (roleBadges) roleBadges.innerHTML = `\n                    <span class=\"chip-btn chip-success\">✓ Verify Credentials</span>\n                    <span class=\"chip-btn chip-success\">✓ Blockchain Ledger</span>\n                    <span class=\"chip-btn\" style=\"background:#fee2e2; color:#991b1b;\">✕ No Issuance Rights</span>\n                    <span class=\"chip-btn\" style=\"background:#fee2e2; color:#991b1b;\">✕ No Revocation Rights</span>\n                `;\n            } else if (role === 'ROLE_INSTITUTION') {\n                if (btnIssue) btnIssue.style.display = 'inline-flex';\n                if (tabQuals) tabQuals.style.display = 'inline-flex';\n                if (tabTelemetry) tabTelemetry.style.display = 'none'; // Officers cannot access internal server telemetry\n\n                document.getElementById('dashHeaderTitle').innerText = 'Registrar Credential Management & Issuance Portal';\n                document.getElementById('dashHeaderSubtitle').innerText = 'Issue new accredited qualifications, manage institutional registry, and verify credentials.';\n\n                if (roleIcon) roleIcon.innerText = '🏛️';\n                const instName = user.institutionName || 'Accredited Institution';\n                if (roleTitle) roleTitle.innerText = `Registrar Officer Session (${user.username} - ${instName})`;\n                if (roleDesc) roleDesc.innerText = 'Scope: Institutional credential issuance & registry management. System server telemetry and credential revocation are restricted.';\n                if (roleBadges) roleBadges.innerHTML = `\n                    <span class=\"chip-btn chip-success\">✓ Issue Qualifications</span>\n                    <span class=\"chip-btn chip-success\">✓ Manage Registry</span>\n                    <span class=\"chip-btn chip-success\">✓ Verify Credentials</span>\n                    <span class=\"chip-btn chip-danger\">✕ Revocation Restricted (Admin Only)</span>\n                `;\n            } else if (role === 'ROLE_ADMIN') {\n                if (btnIssue) btnIssue.style.display = 'inline-flex';\n                if (tabQuals) tabQuals.style.display = 'inline-flex';\n                if (tabTelemetry) tabTelemetry.style.display = 'inline-flex';\n\n                document.getElementById('dashHeaderTitle').innerText = 'Master Credential Administration & DevOps Telemetry';\n                document.getElementById('dashHeaderSubtitle').innerText = 'Full administrative control: credential issuance, official revocation, server JVM telemetry, and blockchain audits.';\n\n                if (roleIcon) roleIcon.innerText = '🛡️';\n                if (roleTitle) roleTitle.innerText = `System Administrator Session (${user.username} - Master Authority)`;\n                if (roleDesc) roleDesc.innerText = 'Scope: Master authority across all institutional registries, exclusive credential revocation, system telemetry, and audit trails.';\n                if (roleBadges) roleBadges.innerHTML = `\n                    <span class=\"chip-btn chip-success\">✓ Master Privileges</span>\n                    <span class=\"chip-btn chip-danger\">✓ Exclusive Revocation Authority</span>\n                    <span class=\"chip-btn chip-success\">✓ Server Telemetry & Audits</span>\n                `;\n            }\n\n            // 3. Tab routing via URL query parameter\n            const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n            const targetTab = params.get('tab');\n            const certQuery = params.get('cert');\n\n            if (targetTab === 'qualificationsTab' && role !== 'ROLE_VERIFIER') {\n                switchTab('qualificationsTab', document.getElementById('tabBtnQuals'));\n            } else if (targetTab === 'blockchainTab') {\n                switchTab('blockchainTab', document.getElementById('tabBtnBlockchain'));\n            } else if (targetTab === 'aiTab') {\n                switchTab('aiTab', document.getElementById('tabBtnAi'));\n            } else if (targetTab === 'telemetryTab' && role === 'ROLE_ADMIN') {\n                switchTab('telemetryTab', document.getElementById('tabBtnTelemetry'));\n            } else if (role === 'ROLE_INSTITUTION' && !targetTab) {\n                switchTab('qualificationsTab', document.getElementById('tabBtnQuals'));\n            } else {\n                // Default to Verification Console\n                switchTab('verifyTab', document.getElementById('tabBtnVerify'));\n            }\n\n            // 4. Auto-verify if cert query parameter is present\n            if (certQuery) {\n                const input = document.getElementById('verificationInput');\n                if (input) input.value = certQuery;\n                verifyCredential(certQuery);\n            }\n\n            // 5. Load data\n            if (role !== 'ROLE_VERIFIER') {\n                loadQualifications();\n            }\n            if (role === 'ROLE_ADMIN') {\n                fetchTelemetry();\n            }","StartLine":445,"TargetContent":"            // 2. Role-based adjustments\n            if (user && user.role === 'ROLE_VERIFIER') {\n                const btnIssue = document.getElementById('btnIssueQual');\n                if (btnIssue) btnIssue.style.display = 'none';\n\n                const regSection = document.getElementById('registerSection');\n                if (regSection) regSection.style.display = 'none';\n\n                const title = document.getElementById('dashHeaderTitle');\n                if (title) title.innerText = 'Accredited Credential Verification Portal';\n\n                const sub = document.getElementById('dashHeaderSubtitle');\n                if (sub) sub.innerText = 'Verify academic credentials, inspect blockchain blocks, and evaluate AI fraud heuristics.';\n            }\n\n            // 3. Tab routing via URL query parameter\n            const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n            const targetTab = params.get('tab');\n            const certQuery = params.get('cert');\n\n            if (targetTab === 'qualificationsTab') {\n                switchTab('qualificationsTab', document.getElementById('tabBtnQuals'));\n            } else if (targetTab === 'blockchainTab') {\n                switchTab('blockchainTab', document.getElementById('tabBtnBlockchain'));\n            } else if (targetTab === 'aiTab') {\n                switchTab('aiTab', document.getElementById('tabBtnAi'));\n            } else if (targetTab === 'telemetryTab') {\n                switchTab('telemetryTab', document.getElementById('tabBtnTelemetry'));\n            } else {\n                // Default to Verification Console for authenticated users\n                switchTab('verifyTab', document.getElementById('tabBtnVerify'));\n            }\n\n            // 4. Auto-verify if cert query parameter is present\n            if (certQuery) {\n                const input = document.getElementById('verificationInput');\n                if (input) input.value = certQuery;\n                verifyCredential(certQuery);\n            }\n\n            // 5. Load data\n            loadQualifications();\n            fetchTelemetry();","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Madziva\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\qualification-verification-system\\src\\main\\resources\\templates\\dashboard.html","toolAction":"Updating dashboard.html script","toolSummary":"Enforce role tab access and scope in dashboard"}}]}
